  "body": "Both Title & CCC Issued\r\n\r\nPositioned in one of Browns Bay's most family-friendly locations, these four brand-new standalone homes offer the perfect combination of modern living, convenience, and excellent school zoning. Directly across the road from Sherwood School, children can enjoy a safe and easy one-minute walk to school.\r\n\r\nDesigned for contemporary lifestyles, each home features spacious open-plan living, quality finishes, and low-maintenance outdoor areas, making them ideal for families, professionals, investors, or those seeking a lock-and-leave lifestyle.\r\n\r\nWhy You'll Love These Homes:\r\n\r\n• Brand-new standalone homes with modern design\r\n• Sunny open-plan kitchen, dining, and living areas\r\n• Generous bedrooms and stylish bathrooms\r\n• Easy-care outdoor spaces for entertaining and relaxation\r\n• Internal access garaging and off-street parking\r\n• Directly opposite Sherwood Primary School – just a 1-minute walk for the kids\r\n• Zoned for Sherwood Primary, Northcross Intermediate and Long Bay College\r\n• Minutes from Browns Bay Beach, local shops, cafés, parks, and public transport\r\n• Ideal for families, professionals, and investors\r\n\r\nEnjoy the convenience of having excellent schools, everyday amenities, and beautiful beaches all within easy reach while living in a quality new home built for modern comfort and peace of mind.\r\n\r\nWhether you're looking for your first home, a family upgrade, or a smart investment on the North Shore, these brand-new homes present an outstanding opportunity in a highly desirable location. Contact us today for more information, or visit our open homes. Private viewings are also available by appointment.",
